<title>SINGAPORE: Centrepoint starts marketing office.</title>
<headline>Centrepoint starts marketing office.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrepoint Properties Ltd, part of the Fraser &amp; Neave Ltd group, said on Monday it has started marketing its new office block, Valley Point.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the rents for the office block, located just outside Singapore's central business district, will average around Singapore $6 per sq ft.</p>
<p>The office block has a net lettable area of 186,766 sq ft.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
